if(['food','inventory'].includes(view)&&$('#from').value&&$('#to').value&&$('#from').value<=$('#to').value){$('#mainAction').style.display='none';const head=header();$('#content').innerHTML=head+'<p class="wh-storage-note">Synthetic browser-local workspace · Records stay on this device until exported. Secure shared storage and real email delivery are production setup items.</p>'+(!['donations','usdaItems','counts','transfers','drives','runs'].some(k=>live(wh.db[k]).length)?'<section class="wh-demo-start"><div><strong>Explore a complete fictional month</strong><p>See how receipts, truck returns and USDA counts flow into the report. No real pantry data is included.</p></div>'+btn('Load fictional walkthrough','sample','','primary')+'</section>':'')+panels[tab]();if(view==='food')$('.filterbar').style.display='';$('#periodStatus').textContent='Warehouse month: '+m()+' · daily register has its own date';}
if(view==='reports')$('#content').insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin',card('Warehouse reporting','<p>Use the connected warehouse records for food receipts, USDA commodity cases, physical inventory and residual client pounds.</p><div class="workspace-actions">'+link('USDA report','usda')+link('Month-end reconciliation','close')+link('Download warehouse records','backup')+'</div>'));if(view==='rescue'){const rows=live(wh.db.donations).filter(x=>x.source==='Grocery Rescue'&&x.date.slice(0,7)===m());$('#content').innerHTML=card('Grocery Rescue · '+m(),'<p>Food received here is already included in the incoming food total. Use either detailed pickups or one monthly source, never both.</p><div class="wh-toolbar">'+link('Record a pickup','donations')+link('Review an import','imports')+'</div>'+table2(['Date / period','Donor','Net lb','Source'],rows.map(x=>[H(x.granularity==='month'?x.date.slice(0,7)+' (monthly)':x.date),H(x.donorName),F(x.net),H(x.sourceRef)])))}
const nav=$('#nav');if(nav&&allowedView('inventory')&&!nav.querySelector('[data-wh-nav]')){const el=document.createElement('div');el.dataset.whNav='';el.innerHTML='<div class="nav-section">Warehouse shortcuts</div>'+link('USDA tracking','usda')+link('Month-end review','close')+link('Records & backups','backup');nav.append(el)}
